  "notes": "Mixed-basis city: governmental funds modified cash basis (recorded as cash), business-type accrual. Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4); beginning/ending cash = fund balances 1,205,038 / 1,681,174 (all cash per p3). Transfers in 60,000 is the printed net Total column figure (General +66,541, Keno -6,541; Water/Sewer transfers out 60,000 on p6). Business-type from the proprietary funds statement Total column (p6); no single printed totals, so reported totals are operating + nonoperating sums. Balance sheet: government-wide Statement of Net Position (p1; includes capital assets and debt), primary government only. Trimmed page 2 is only the right half of the Statement of Activities. Detail: General Fund from its budget schedule (p8) because the General Fund departmental combining schedule is only half present (p13 holds the Library/Cemetery/Auditorium/Total columns without row labels; the left half is not in the trimmed PDF), so p13 is not recorded (re-check 2026-11-05: still only the right half in the trim; the object-level General Fund lines need the left-half source page added via config/extra_pages.csv and re-extraction). Street, Sales Tax and Keno budget schedules (p9-11) and the nonmajor combining statement (p12) recorded; no utility fund schedules, so no business-type detail. Read pages 1-13 of 13"
